# Direct dependencies for reference/gen_027_fixtures.py (Feature 027: the sparse encoder's oracle).
#
# torch / transformers / tokenizers / safetensors / numpy are Feature 012's pins
# (reference/requirements-012.in) — the stack the sparse spike measured with, so the oracle
# encodes documents exactly as the spike did. Unlike the 012 and 022 locks, this one is compiled
# with hashes (uv pip compile --generate-hashes), so scripts/setup-reference-venv.sh 027 installs
# it with --require-hashes like the other oracles.
